{"id":8894890,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/merge_requests/4120","number":4120,"state":"merged","title":"修复TopkV2算子的NonTranspose模板精度问题","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/4120","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/4120/issues","body":"## 描述\n本次pr为同步主线问题到商分。主要修复Topk的NonTranspose模板在调用MergeSort算法时，出现的精度问题。\n【问题原因】由于layout.valueRowBytes未与layout.axisRowBytes保持一致（与outputCount*topkV2DataInfo::SORT_STRUCT_BYTES相比取较大值），导致mergesort排序出现索引覆盖问题。\n【问题修复】在 ComputeTopkNonLastLayout中，layout.valueRowBytes 在 useMergeSort 时需要考虑 SORT_STRUCT_BYTES，与 layout.axisRowBytes 保持一致。\n\n## 关联的Issue\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/issues/2244\n\n## 测试\nUT，ST，二级冒烟测试通过\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\n\n","assignees_number":5,"assignees":[{"id":"68d55468c9e33e3d8f4119c6","login":"Andy-lb","name":"Andy-lb","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Andy-lb","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68832881c8d5363aeb8700a4","login":"gitcode-chenjiao","name":"chenjiao","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gitcode-chenjiao","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"687871f1fc42115893adcd09","login":"jiangtao_rts","name":"jiangtao","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/jiangtao_rts","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"689ae799edeee41e78b94859","login":"hanxiaolong","name":"shane","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hanxiaolong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68d502180329437872e54496","login":"gcw_kUomxQ2l","name":"liulun0308","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gcw_kUomxQ2l","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false}],"testers":[],"approval_reviewers":[{"id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","login":"songkai111","name":"songkai111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/songkai111","assignee":false,"code_owner":false,"accept":false,"accept_sta